  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2510.01346v2</id>
    <title>Aristotle: IMO-level Automated Theorem Proving</title>
    <updated>2025-10-10T20:12:14Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.01346v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.01346v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We introduce Aristotle, an AI system that combines formal verification with informal reasoning, achieving gold-medal-equivalent performance on the 2025 International Mathematical Olympiad problems. Aristotle integrates three main components: a Lean proof search system, an informal reasoning system that generates and formalizes lemmas, and a dedicated geometry solver. Our system demonstrates state-of-the-art performance with favorable scaling properties for automated theorem proving.</summary>
    <category term="cs.AI" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <category term="cs.CL" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
